  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.22\n- An About button says which build you have, where the tool lives and how to report a fault.\n\nv1.2.21\n- Nothing in the tool can be pressed while an answer from the environment is still on its way.\n- An answer that arrives late is dropped, so closing the tab or opening another template mid-fetch is safe.\n- Switching to another environment clears the last one's templates, so one org's list is never shown as another's.\n- An environment that could not be reached says so, instead of looking like one with no templates in it.\n- Templates are read in the background, so opening a large .docx no longer freezes the window while it loads.\n\nv1.2.20 - Rename to \"Document Template XRay\". The hyphen in \"X-Ray\" meant a search for \"xray\" in the XrmToolBox tools list did not match this tool.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/comentality/xrm-document-template-xray/blob/v1.2.22/CHANGELOG.md",
